					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.370
				</span></i>
			: aor. 2
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπέστῠγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.</u>
